N: 88200
T: !N
H: !32
H: H+1
D: H-3
B: H-8
C: H-16
A: (1%H)*(e(0-D*D*.3)+e(0-B*B*.2)*.8+e(0-C*C*.15)*.5)

F1: 438
F2: 442
P1: T*(F1*6.283182%44100)
P2: T*(F2*6.283182%44100)
W1: w P1 $ A
W2: w P2 $ A
W_mix: (W1 + W2) * 0.5

Env: (T<22050)*(T%22050) + (T>22049)*(1 - ((T-22050)%66150))
W: W_mix * Env
